<title>ROMANIA: Soccer-Romania beat Ireland 1-0 in Cup qualifier.</title>
<headline>Soccer-Romania beat Ireland 1-0 in Cup qualifier.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania beat Ireland 1-0 (halftime 1-0) in their World Cup group eight qualifier on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer - Adrian Ilie 32</p>
<p>Attendance: 18,000</p>
<p>  Standings	    P   W   D   L   F   A   Pts</p>
<p> 1. Romania	    6   6   0   0  20   0   18</p>
<p> 2. Macedonia	  6   3   1   2  18  10   10</p>
<p> 3. Lithuania	  5   3   0   2   6   5    9</p>
<p> 4. Ireland	    5   2   1   2  10   4    7</p>
<p> 5. Iceland	    4   0   2   2   1   7    2</p>
<p> 6. Liechtenstein    6   0   0   6   2  31    0</p>
</text>
